OL,3,GNEWSARare Qing dynasty vases fetch #24k
OL,4,Aat auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pair of rare Chinese vases thought to
OL,7,Fbe from the 17th Century have sold for
OL,8,F#24,000 at auction.
OL,10,FThe two Chinese Famille Verte 'Ladies'
OL,11,FVases are thought to date back to the
OL,12,FKangxi period of the Qing dynasty,
OL,13,Fbetween 1662 and 1722.
OL,15,FThey sold for a combined total of
OL,16,F#24,000 at Mallams auction house in
OL,17,FCheltenham on Wednesday - below their
OL,18,Festimated price of between #30,000 and
OL,19,F#50,000.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
