OL,3,GNEWSARare Qing dynasty vases fetch #24k
OL,4,Aat auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the sale, Mallams explained
OL,7,Fthat the vases had been in an
OL,8,FOxfordshire country house and
OL,9,Frepresented "an extraordinary
OL,10,Frediscovery of Chinese porcelain".
